A POM that is not well-formed XML fails resolution of its artifact.
--- module.yaml
product: jvm/lib
repositories:
  - mavenLocal
dependencies:
  - org.example:broken:1.0
--- m2/org/example/broken/1.0/broken-1.0.pom
<project xmlns="http://maven.apache.org/POM/4.0.0">
  <modelVersion>4.0.0</modelVersion>
  <groupId>org.example
</project>
--- krusty-refusal
error	<directory>/home/.m2/repository/org/example/broken/1.0/broken-1.0.pom:4:1: ERROR: Unable to parse the POM of org.example:broken:1.0: the POM is not well-formed XML: expected 'groupId' tag, not 'project'
